  "description": "Uploads GarminRunerz workouts to a Garmin Connect account through the unofficial Garmin Connect web API, and manages race events on its calendar. Supports creating, updating, scheduling and deleting workouts, and creating, reading, listing, updating and deleting race events.",
  "id": "GarminRunerz.Connect",
