  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0: adds race events on the Garmin Connect calendar over the token path (calendar-service). New IRaceEventService / TokenRaceEventService (ListAsync, GetAsync returning null on 404, CreateAsync, UpdateAsync as a full-record PUT, DeleteAsync) registered by AddGarminConnectTokenUploader(), and new per-user IGarminRaceEventManager / GarminRaceEventManager (ListRaceEventsAsync, GetRaceEventAsync, CreateRaceEventAsync, UpdateRaceEventAsync, DeleteRaceEventAsync, and the idempotent EnsureRaceEventAsync: one list over Date-1..Date+1 ranked by the pure RaceEventMatcher, create only when no open event with the same name is on the date or the day next to it, returning RaceEventResult(Event, Created, Match, SameDayOthers)) registered by AddGarminConnectionManager(), sharing IGarminConnectionManager's exception contract (GarminReconnectRequiredException on a dead token, GarminAuthenticationException on a temporary refresh failure, one refresh-and-retry on 401). Client-side checks mirror Garmin's hard failures (blank name, partial start time, non-positive target, unknown eventType unless allowUnknownEventType). Requires GarminRunerz.Workout.Models 2.1.0 for the RaceEvent model. Additive, no breaking change: IGarminConnectionManager and IWorkoutUploadService are unchanged.",
